178: 
179: Submit the following files as instructed by HackerRank:
180: 
181: | File | Description |
182: |---|---|
183: | `code.zip` | Full runnable solution, prompts/configuration, README, and the required `evaluation/` folder |
184: | `output.csv` | Predictions for every row in `dataset/requests.csv` |
185: | `chat_transcript` | The `log.txt` described above, showing how you developed or used the system |
